        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SNJ5014FRDSST, Old World Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe hand forged Old World Door style pull with backplate is available in either dark Duro Bronze, Matte Black, or Lithonia (powder coat oil rubbed bronze) finishes. It is 14-3/4 inches long with 13 inch mounting centers. \r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door. Standard for 1-1/4\" or thicker wood, composite or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions SNJ5014FRDSST 14-3/4 Inch San Juan Handle with Backplate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14-3/4</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SNJ05-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262331\"><b>First Impressions SNJ5014FRDSST Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</i>\r\n</p>",
